[46.4433, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[24B\u001b[38;5;174m\u2736\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[46.5525, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[19B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling\u001b[11Gverdict\u2026\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[46.7264, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, called \u001b[25Gerdict \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[39m The evaluation flagged one\u001b[30Gline\u001b[35Gas\u001b[38Gunsafe:\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Gpromise\u001b[56Gof\u001b[59Gguaranteed\u001b[70Gcredit-line\u001b[82Gapproval\u001b[91Gat\u001b[94G[1:02],\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhich\u001b[9Gbreaks\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gbrief's\u001b[28Gmust-not\u001b[37Glist.\u001b[43GI'm\u001b[47Gremoving\u001b[56Gthat\u001b[61Gline\u001b[66Gand\u001b[70Gleaving\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Grest\u001b[87Gof\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gscript\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Balone.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(script.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mRemoved \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m [0:48] Week two, I set a grocery budget with my roommate. We both see the same numb\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m er, and it updates when either of us pays.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 15 -\u001b[38;5;231m[1:02] And if money is tight, Tallyleaf guarantees you'll be approved for a credit \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m    -\u001b[38;5;231mline, no credit check, 100% of the time.                                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 16 -\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 15 \u001b[22m [1:10] By day 30 I'd spent $386 less than the month before. Not because of willpowe\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m r; I just stopped being surprised.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m [1:22] What I'd change: the charts are a bit small on my phone, and the web app is \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m still in beta.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mCalling\u001b[11Gverdict\u2026\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
